@startuml pdf-pipeline
' PdfExtractor::extract — route, shell out to a Python backend, post-process.
' Dashed edges mark configuration that is accepted but never reaches the backend.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/pdf-pipeline.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 1 in docs/components/sources/pdf.md
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  BorderColor #263238
  roundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
top to bottom direction

legend top right
|= Concept |= Color |
| PDF → LaTeX module | <back:#EF6C00>        </back> |
| external Python tool | <back:#546E7A>        </back> |
| neural model | <back:#2E7D32>        </back> |
| accepted but not wired | <back:#455A64>        </back> |
endlegend

rectangle "**paper.pdf**" as pdf #546E7A
rectangle "**PdfConfig**\nrouter · postprocess\npython_path · device · timeouts\nbatch_workers · temp_dir" as cfg #EF6C00
rectangle "**PdfExtractor::new**\nkeeps router + postprocess only" as new #EF6C00
rectangle "**unused config**\npython_path · marker_path · nougat_path\ntemp_dir · page_timeout · document_timeout\nbatch_workers · keep_temp_files\nmax_memory_per_worker · device" as dead #455A64

rectangle "**PdfRouter::route(path)**\nanalyze ⇒ RouterDecision\n{ backend, reason, analysis, fallback }" as route #EF6C00

rectangle "**MarkerBackend**\npython3 -c '…'\nTORCH_DEVICE=cpu (hard-coded)" as marker #546E7A
rectangle "**NougatBackend**\nnougat --out - --model 0.1.0-base\n--no-skipping" as nougat #546E7A
rectangle "**LayoutLMv3 + OCR**\nlayout-aware parse" as m_model #2E7D32
rectangle "**Swin encoder + mBART decoder**\nneural OCR, math-first" as n_model #2E7D32

rectangle "**markdown_to_latex**\nheaders · code · bold · italic" as m2l #EF6C00
rectangle "**mathpix_markdown_to_latex**\nMMD already carries \\[ … \\] and $ … $" as mmd2l #EF6C00

rectangle "**ExtractedDocument**\npages: Vec<ExtractedPage> (always len 1)\nlatex · metadata · stats" as doc #EF6C00
rectangle "**PostProcessor::process**\nsix passes, then informational validation" as post #EF6C00
rectangle "**LaTeX**\nready for the latex / ngram modules" as out #EF6C00

pdf --> route
cfg --> new
new --> route : RouterConfig
new --> post : PostProcessorConfig
cfg -[#455A64,dashed]-> dead : dropped by PdfExtractor::new

route --> marker : Backend::Marker
route --> nougat : Backend::Nougat
marker --> m_model : subprocess
nougat --> n_model : subprocess
m_model --> m2l : rendered.markdown
n_model --> mmd2l : Mathpix Markdown
m2l --> doc
mmd2l --> doc
doc --> post
post --> out

note bottom of route
  Backend::Auto must be resolved here.
  If it reaches the extractor, extract()
  returns PdfError::Configuration.
  RouterDecision.fallback is computed
  but never acted upon.
end note
@enduml
